  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingDividendTextBlock contextRef="Prior1YearDuration">&lt;p class="smt_head6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:45pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;２．配当に関する事項&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 class="smt_head3" style="padding-left:54pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;(1) 配当金支払額&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:54pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;　　該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:7pt;font-size:7pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 class="smt_head3" style="padding-left:54pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;(2) 基準日が当連結会計年度に属する配当のうち、配当の効力発生日が翌連結会計年度となるもの&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:36pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"&gt;
